===Pronunciation===
*{{audio|en-us-bellow.ogg|Audio (US)}}
*:Rhymes: [[Rhymes:English:-ɛləʊ|-ɛləʊ]]

===Etymology===
Middle English [[belwen]], from Old English [[bylgian]], cognate with [[belg]] “leather bag,” [[bellan]] “to roar,” [[blawan|blāwan]] “to blow”

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}
# the deep [[roar]] of a large animal, or any similar loud noise

====Translations====
*Finnish: [[karjaisu]]

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# to make such a noise
# to shout or scream in a deep voice

